                    Hague.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d594-f2" n="48" xml:id="d594-f2-content">
                <p>Lt. Gen. Sir Montague Stopford, British Commander, Allied Forces, Netherlands
                    East Indies.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d594-f3" n="49" xml:id="d594-f3-content">
                <p>“Vice President, Republic of Indonesia”.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
